values (1, $q$Miles of pipe by material$q$, $q$How many miles of water main does Haw Valley Water own of each pipe material? One mile is 5,280 feet. Round miles to 2 decimal places.$q$, $q$material, miles — most miles first$q$, true, 4,
$q$SELECT material,
